  "body": "Positioned in the heart of highly sought-after Milford, this near-new freestanding home presents an outstanding opportunity for families, professionals, investors or those looking for a quality lock-up-and-leave lifestyle.\r\n\r\nOffering the perfect combination of modern design, practical living and an enviable coastal location, this beautifully presented home is ready for you to move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a light-filled open-plan living and dining area, complemented by a sleek contemporary kitchen and quality finishes throughout. The seamless connection to the private deck creates an inviting space for morning coffee, weekend entertaining or relaxed family gatherings.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtfully designed layout features four generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite, two stylish bathrooms plus a guest toilet, providing plenty of flexibility for modern family living. A carpeted internal-access garage and excellent storage further enhance the home's practicality.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. Milford is renowned for its relaxed coastal lifestyle, with Milford Beach, village cafés, boutique shopping, supermarkets, restaurants and scenic coastal walks all within easy reach. Everything you need for everyday convenience is right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nFamilies will also appreciate the exceptional school zoning, including Milford Primary, Campbells Bay Primary, Takapuna Intermediate, Carmel College, Westlake Boys' High School and Westlake Girls' High School.\r\n\r\nAdding further peace of mind is the balance of the 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, giving you confidence in both the quality of the home and your investment.\r\n\r\nWhether you're searching for your next family home, a low-maintenance investment or a modern property in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal suburbs, this is an opportunity worth serious consideration.\r\n\r\nModern. Freestanding. Low maintenance. Milford lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWith the vendors motivated and ready to see action, this home deserves your immediate attention.",
